From cb5a3d332444fb36e010a96b179913657bc9412f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 04:47:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] authenticate receipt-derived restrictions during
 safety supersession

Replay a capability-unavailable retain superseded by safety through actual feed apply; preserve monotone safety/accounting even when the separate canonical restriction annotation lags. Only an independently confirmed owned command and byte-equal event can bridge the feed; reserved historical or ACK-only lookalikes never attest themselves.

Proof: receipt feed regression RED2 before correction; expanded retain/spend/refusal integration GREEN. No new hold ledger, release grant or provider execution.
